<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT SEMIFINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WORLD INDOOR TOURNAMENT SEMIFINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinals results on the</p>
<p>sixth day of the $750,000 men's Rotterdam World Indoor tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat 3-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-7 (5-7) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) beat 1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 6-4 1-6 7-6 (7-2).</p>
</text>
